        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Polar Bear cocktail, After Eight, Peppermint Paddy, Daiquiri\n- Concepts: Cocktails, mint chocolate cocktails, cocktail ingredients\n\nFacts:\n- The Polar Bear cocktail is also called After Eight or Peppermint Paddy.\n- The Polar Bear cocktail is a mint chocolate cocktail.\n- The Polar Bear cocktail is described as tasting like a York Peppermint Pattie or an After Eight wafer.\n- Daiquiri is a family of cocktails.\n- Daiquiri cocktails mainly contain rum, citrus juice that is typically lime juice, and sugar or another sweetener.",
